  "tutArrangeTitle": "Arrange",
  "tutArrange": "Your hand sits along the bottom, already split into the four groups. Drag a card onto another card to swap them, or tap two cards. Drag a group by its label to swap whole groups. Tap Ready when you are happy. Nobody sees your groups until they are played.",
  "tutPlayTitle": "Play",
  "tutPlay": "Once everyone is Ready, the groups are revealed automatically: everyone's strongest group first, then the next strongest, and so on. The 4-card group goes wherever it ranks. The strongest group in each turn wins it, and its owner leads the next one.",
  "tutRankTitle": "Ranking",
  "tutRank3": "Four of a kind > Trail (three of a kind) > Double run (run in one suit) > Run > Color (same suit) > Two pair > Pair > High card. A-K-Q is the top run, then A-2-3.",
  "tutRank4Title": "The 4-card group",
  "tutRank4": "It counts as the best hand inside it, so three spades in it make a Color. When all four cards make the hand (a 4-card color or run), it beats any 3-card hand of that kind: a 4-card color with 8 high beats a 3-card color with A. To beat it you need a stronger 4-card color, or a run, double run or trail.",
  "tutTieTitle": "Ties",
  "tutTie": "Equal groups compare card by card from the highest. If every rank matches, the suit of the highest card decides: spades, hearts, diamonds, clubs.",
  "tutScoreTitle": "Scoring",
  "tutScore": "Each group won: 1 point. All four groups: 5 points in total. Special hands: while arranging, tap Show to end the round with four of a kind +4, six pairs +6 or three trails +9. Showing one card of every rank (A to K) wins the match.",
  "tutEndTitle": "Winning",
  "tutEnd": "The first player to reach {target} points wins. If several pass it in the same round, the highest total wins; an exact tie plays another round.",
